  "name": "luh-measurement-data-and-bayoma-identification-results-of-a-31-m-wind-turbine-rotor-blade",
  "notes": "The presented dataset contains measurement data and the corresponding modal parameters eigenfrequencies and eigenmodes identified using Bayesian operational modal analysis (BayOMA) of a 31 m wind turbine rotor blade tested under fatigue loading. More information is available in the readme file.\r\n\r\nThe dataset is published alongside the article \"Damage identification on a large-scale wind turbine rotor blade using sample-based deterministic model updating\" by Wolniak et al., submitted to Wind Energy Science in October 2025.",
